{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <strong>BloomTale</strong>, where your creativity blossoms as you run your very own flower shop. Each flower carries a unique meaning, and your mission is to master the language of flowers by crafting thoughtful arrangements that reflect your customers\u2019 feelings. Tend to your blooms, customize your shop, and watch your reputation grow and flourish with every bouquet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/694592ca4d8b7df4829d5d6d92564400.avif?t=1770012854\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft bouquets:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flowers are more than just decoration. Each bloom carries its own meaning, letting you craft bouquets that symbolize love, hope, apology, or even luck. Mix and match flowers, colors, wraps, ribbons, and decorations to create arrangements with a truly personal touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/31b908fac458f11ce2ba37aa896a3e0a.poster.avif?t=1770012854\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/31b908fac458f11ce2ba37aa896a3e0a.webm?t=1770012854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/31b908fac458f11ce2ba37aa896a3e0a.mp4?t=1770012854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the locals:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet over 15 unique customers, each with their own story and a little bit of whimsy. Pick flowers or craft bouquets to match their requests and enjoy watching their personalities grow with each visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/3390ed617c380e7723b4180303841326.poster.avif?t=1770012854\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/3390ed617c380e7723b4180303841326.webm?t=1770012854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/3390ed617c380e7723b4180303841326.mp4?t=1770012854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate your home:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your shop grows, so does the world around it. Unlock visual upgrades, personalize your home, and create a space that matches your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/331d99381e718a77c9f954dc22374718.poster.avif?t=1770012854\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/331d99381e718a77c9f954dc22374718.webm?t=1770012854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/331d99381e718a77c9f954dc22374718.mp4?t=1770012854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garden and flower collection:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over 50 unique flowers, each with its own meaning, and fill your magical garden with vibrant blooms. Keep your garden happy and discover tiny visitors wandering among your flowers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/8fc20bc860b85b8f106135ec0b694492.poster.avif?t=1770012854\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/8fc20bc860b85b8f106135ec0b694492.webm?t=1770012854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/8fc20bc860b85b8f106135ec0b694492.mp4?t=1770012854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3168520?t=1770012854","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770012854","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/fd0e06da69f58bb9531bff8fecf362aa6ee419df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770012854","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/fd0e06da69f58bb9531bff8fecf362aa6ee419df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770012854","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3473530,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>BloomTale</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/42609dae6564ba1a5e917426d47c03b9.avif?t=1770012854\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <strong>BloomTale</strong>, where your creativity blossoms as you run your very own flower shop. Each flower carries a unique meaning, and your mission is to master the language of flowers by crafting thoughtful arrangements that reflect your customers\u2019 feelings. Tend to your blooms, customize your shop, and watch your reputation grow and flourish with every bouquet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/694592ca4d8b7df4829d5d6d92564400.avif?t=1770012854\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft bouquets:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flowers are more than just decoration. Each bloom carries its own meaning, letting you craft bouquets that symbolize love, hope, apology, or even luck. Mix and match flowers, colors, wraps, ribbons, and decorations to create arrangements with a truly personal touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/31b908fac458f11ce2ba37aa896a3e0a.poster.avif?t=1770012854\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/31b908fac458f11ce2ba37aa896a3e0a.webm?t=1770012854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/31b908fac458f11ce2ba37aa896a3e0a.mp4?t=1770012854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the locals:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet over 15 unique customers, each with their own story and a little bit of whimsy. Pick flowers or craft bouquets to match their requests and enjoy watching their personalities grow with each visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/3390ed617c380e7723b4180303841326.poster.avif?t=1770012854\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/3390ed617c380e7723b4180303841326.webm?t=1770012854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/3390ed617c380e7723b4180303841326.mp4?t=1770012854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate your home:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your shop grows, so does the world around it. Unlock visual upgrades, personalize your home, and create a space that matches your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/331d99381e718a77c9f954dc22374718.poster.avif?t=1770012854\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/331d99381e718a77c9f954dc22374718.webm?t=1770012854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/331d99381e718a77c9f954dc22374718.mp4?t=1770012854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garden and flower collection:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over 50 unique flowers, each with its own meaning, and fill your magical garden with vibrant blooms. Keep your garden happy and discover tiny visitors wandering among your flowers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/8fc20bc860b85b8f106135ec0b694492.poster.avif?t=1770012854\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/8fc20bc860b85b8f106135ec0b694492.webm?t=1770012854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/8fc20bc860b85b8f106135ec0b694492.mp4?t=1770012854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Floralia Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/header.jpg?t=1770012854","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 10.10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory, OpenGL 2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3168520/833361/c69915f4327195e13b912b62213c9e6914af887a/1750877187/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740470070","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3168520/833361/c69915f4327195e13b912b62213c9e6914